# Build output
bin/
obj/

# Generated against YOUR install by `ppcli.ps1 index`: it carries that install's mods and pins that
# install's game build, so it is never published. aliases.ndjson is curated by hand and is committed.
catalog/defs.ndjson
catalog/meta.json

# Written by `deploy` with THIS machine's install path. Read by paths.ps1, never shipped.
ppcli-install.txt

# Game and client runtime droppings
Console.log
*.tmp

# Internal lab notes and drivers. NOT published: each names this machine's install or its Steam
# profile id, and each is addressed to us rather than to a user of the tool.
#   - the two capability notes read as a list of things the tool CANNOT do, which is the wrong
#     front page for a consumer; the work they describe already landed in the published docs.
#   - headless-harness.md documents ContentTool's autogate.ps1 / AutoRun.cs, which do not exist
#     in this tree at all.
#   - spider-demo.ps1 needs com.morgott.ContentTool + morgott.demo.customcreature, neither of
#     which a PPCLI user has.
CODEX-gap-research.md
